### Research attribution versus implementation evidence / 科研署名与实现证据

中文：本文件是作者和公开身份记录，不是代码验证报告、科学独立复现记录或外部机构资格证明；Axiom 的具体能力以本仓 CODE、明确输入和可检查的实验记录判断

English: This is an authorship and public-identity record, not an implementation test, independent reproduction or external certification. Axiom capabilities are judged from CODE, explicit inputs and inspectable experiments

